pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Languidly.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b6/Languidly..png/revision/latest?cb=20231005233454\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Languidly.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b6/Languidly..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231005233454\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b6/Languidly..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231005233454 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b6/Languidly..png/revision/latest?cb=20231005233454 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Languidly.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Languidly..png\" data-image-name=\"Languidly..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\">Sam Campbell</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hell_is_here.\" title=\"Hell is here.\">Hell is here.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dynamite_chicks.\" title=\"Dynamite chicks.\">Dynamite chicks.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Languidly.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">Series 16</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 5 October 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\">Sam Campbell</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Languidly.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Languidly\" is how <a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\">Julian Clary</a> describes how he approached the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_underneath_the_most_unique_things\" title=\"Get underneath the most unique things\">Get underneath the most unique things</a> task. The title card is of a duck on a ball, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_underneath_the_most_unique_things\" title=\"Get underneath the most unique things\">Get underneath the most unique things</a> task, while the ball references the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_ball_in_the_hole\" title=\"Get the ball in the hole\">Get the ball in the hole</a> task, despite being a different ball than the one used in the task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Languidly.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Verkkaisesti', which translates as 'Leisurely'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Slarvigt', which translates as 'Carelessly'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Langsomt', which translates as 'Slowly'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Languidly.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Julian Clary</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lucy Beaumont</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sam Campbell</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sue Perkins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Susan Wokoma</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_present_you%27ve_been_given_that_raises_the_most_questions\" title=\"The present you&#39;ve been given that raises the most questions\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The present you've been given that raises the most questions.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_ball_in_the_hole\" title=\"Get the ball in the hole\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get the ball in the hole. Nothing may touch the ball. After you touch one tool, you may not touch another tool for one minute. If you decide to touch the welly, you must only do so with your foot.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_underneath_the_most_unique_things\" title=\"Get underneath the most unique things\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get underneath the most unique things. Alex will write down your things when you shout \"I'm underneath it\". If you get underneath something that someone else gets underneath, you both lose five things from your total.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Choose_a_new_nickname_based_on_something_you_do\" title=\"Choose a new nickname based on something you do\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Choose a new nickname based on something you do in the next 20 minutes.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Land_your_cushion_in_each_of_the_three_sleep_squares\" title=\"Land your cushion in each of the three sleep squares\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> One member of your team must lie on three of the squares and go to sleep. After they have taken their position, they must not move until the task is over. Taking it in turns, the other team members must try to land their cushion in each of the three sleep squares.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">24\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Languidly.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sue Perkins' attempt in the \"Get the ball in the hole\" task was used in an ident for Channel 4's 'Be Lazy. Just Vote.\" campaign in 2024 to get the general public to vote in the election<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 400px\"> \t<video src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/TM_be_lazy_just_vote.mp4/revision/latest?cb=20241006180436\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" class=\"thumbimage\" style=\"max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; width: 400px; height: 400px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:TM_be_lazy_just_vote.mp4\">https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:TM_be_lazy_just_vote.mp4</a></video> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:TM_be_lazy_just_vote.mp4\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Languidly.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/languidly\"><i>Languidly.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>Languidly.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141522\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.129 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.186 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 839/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 170/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive